- I took up the role of a blockchain team leader in two startups at once.
- Completely took over the development and support of the cryptocurrency exchange blockchain back-end after 9 months in the company; 
- Provided functionality of the cold wallets; in case of a successful hacker attack it would reduce losses in 50-100 times;
- Optimized blockchain fees for different protocols which saved thousands of dollars per month; 
- Figured out and added over 20 different blockchain protocols to exchange; 
- Optimized logging and health monitors using telegram bots;

