candidate_profile:
Position:
Chief Product Officer/ Head of Product Department

Moreinfo:
Certified Scrum Product Owner with 15+ years of experience in managing and creating projects of various complexity. The key competences are development and operating of high-load gambling platforms. As a CPO managed a team of 50+ employees within 6 business units.
Executed over 400+ products: from web-sites for luxury brands to powerful SaaS platforms in Gambling. 
As a curator of Digital Production Direction shared knowledge with students of IKRA and Netology courses.

Looking For:
• Execute sophisticated products and build a team of product enthusiasts.
• Conversion Rate & Funnels Optimization
• Retention Strategy
• Perform Data-driven Decisions

Highlights:
• As a CPO managed a team of 50+ employees within 6 business units;
• Managed from idea to implementation ten big iGaming SaaS platforms + mobile versions for CIS, Europe and Australia: overall traffic exceeded 2,5 million unique visitors per month;
• Developed unique product features tracking and analytics, which resulted in the growth of delivery efficiency by 45%;
• Recruited, built a team and efficient department workflow for 22 people, including developers, designers, BA, PM and Affiliate Managers;
• Invented and implemented a sophisticated retention tool that increased sales managers' sales by four times for a quarter;
• Conducted a retention and promo strategy based on weekend packaged bonuses that resulted in a 30% growth of product email income within six months;
• Implemented a product security system that prevents brut actions and shields from DDoS attacks of various complexity;
• Managed A/B testing campaigns that helped to increase active mobile users by three times for a quarter.

