2) Hired 5 targeters (FB ads) in 1 month, trained them practically from scratch. Increased advertising activity by several times and saved a lot of money on salaries by training newbies.

3) Co-founded an educational project. Created 5 own training programs in the following fields: Copywriting, Content Marketing, E-mail Marketing, School of Project Managers, Info-Products packaging. Trained over 500 people.

4) Helped to create several training programs that are still relevant in the marketplace (example at IPS, the "Influence! The Art of Communication." New product launches, advertising and sales.

5) The turnover of the first project I launched (after 1.5 months of work in this area) was: 410 000 UAH at the rate of 11 UAH per dollar.

6) My first course, in which I was a speaker in 2015 (developed myself, implemented the marketing strategy, heating) earned about $ 18,000.

7) Achieved the “Gold Director” qualification at age 21 in “tianDe” company. The turnover of the team I built over 2 years (over 3000 clients and distributors) in selling beauty products, cosmetics reached $45,000 per month.

8) Leading private consultations and training in: crypto investments, blockchain.

9) Concluded, launched and promoted several major partnerships worth several million dollars
Hi there!

I've been growing in marketing since 2008, in this sequence:

-"tianDe" Company, Director of Network Structure (wholesale, distribution, import/export, MLM) B2C;

-Project Manager at "Isaac Pintosevich Systems" (IT, education) B2B, B2C;

-Co-founder and CMO of educational company "MBM" (IT, education, MLM) B2C;

-Owner of my own educational project (IT, education) B2B, B2C;

-Co-founder and CMO of "Pride Int." company (IT, SaaS, crypto, mobile app, education) B2B, B2C;

-Head of Marketing at "Semalt" (IT, SaaS) B2B;

-Creative Head of Marketing at "X100 Holding" (IT, Fintech, investments, franchising) B2B, B2C;

-Senior Digital Marketing Specialist at "NDA" (The largest crypto exchange in Ukraine and Europe)

-Many project work: Adsy (SaaS, B2B/B2C) , Evans Crypto (Well-known blogger on YouTube), Forex Tester 5 (SaaS for traders, B2C), etc.

I have extensive experience in foreign markets, especially USA, India, and Europe.

I have touched all areas in marketing, I can do a lot with my own hands, and you can read more about my skills, achievements and experience in my CV (so, contact me, there are a lot of interesting things and cases in it ;). I will try to give you a case, a portfolio, an example (if needed) to any of your question.

My current location is Montenegro. I have stable Internet, electricity and the ability to work.
I would like to work with:

-interesting SaaS project that I could use myself;
-interesting software, an application, etc., which would be really useful, solve a problem;
-blockchain, crypto;
-an entertainment sphere, gaming;
-interesting idea.

I dont want to work with something boring, such as: furniture, selling windows, a company which produces harvesters for crushing birch twigs (joking:). 

Sell, promote, improve... But I would like to be a fan of the product/service. (if you know what I mean:)).

candidate_profile:
Position:
CISO/Program/Delivery Manager

Moreinfo:
Highly experienced Cyber Security and Information/Operation Risk Management professional with a proven track record in the cloud and application security, IRM/ORM practice, including operations, consulting, incident handling, and auditing. I have strong technical and practical background, a good understanding of business, technical, physical, and human issues as well. Good at writing and presenting Cyber Security, IRM/ORM, IT Audit challenges to broaden audiences with knowledge, humor, and involvement. 

Proficient in Web Application Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing, Static Code Review, Software Composition Analysis. Proficient in deployment and maintenance of Microfocus Fortify and WebInspect Enterprise components. Responsible for conducting and reviewing DAST/SAST scans on Web and thick Client applications.

As an example, The following services were delivered to the one of the Customers:

•	Cloud Security (Azure, AWS)
•	Applications Security (SAST/DAST and internal penetration testing).
•	Application Security Risk Management.
•	Microfocus Fortify Infrastructure deployment from the scratch and maintenance.
•	SOC2 Type I, II Audit, Compliance. 
•	DevOps/DevSecOps Services.

Highlights:
•	Creating and Managing the Application Security Program from scratch and implemented throughout the enterprise;
•	Formulating and implementing monitoring, policies, procedures and standards relating to application security;
•	In-House Fortify SSC and WebInspect Enterprise Infrastructure deployment for POC and PRODUCTION environments;
•	Integrating Fortify SSC (SAST) and Fortify WebInspect Enterprise (DAST) into CI/CD pipeline;
•	Operationalizing the SAST and DAST tooling – performing SAST and DAST assessments on the regular basis;
•	Performing Vulnerability Validation / False Positive Analysis on automated tools findings and working with developers to remediate them;
•	Documenting the Secure Coding Guidelines and Misuse Cases / Checklist for Manual Penetration Testing;
•	Cloud infrastructure (Azure, AWS) security – conducting the cloud infrastructure security assessments on the basis;
•	Implementing SOC 2 Type II requirements and obtaining the SOC 2 Type I and II audit certificate for the organization;
•	Implementation of the Non-Financial Risk Management Framework & Information Security Management System (ISMS) in accordance to ISO 27000:2017 and ISO 31000 Standards;
•	Company Certification according to ISO 27001:2017;
•	The implementation the Crisis & Business Continuity Management Framework according to ISO 22301 Standard;
•	The implementation of Personal Data protection processes in line with GDPR, Privacy Shield and CCPA regulation;
•	Kubernetes cluster core security concept initial defining and implementation;

