Moreinfo:
18 years of experience in IT of which 11 years as an information security engineer and analyst and 7 years as an IT manager.
I have extensive knowledge and diverse experience to build, maintain and develop IT and/or information security in the company.

• Information Security Management;
• Management of the company's IT infrastructure;
• Performing various security-related tasks in accordance with the security procedure.
• Participation in the management of SIEM (SPLUNK)
• Creating new use cases and improving existing ones, creating
alerts and dashboards, creating reports;
• Development and debugging of security processes and
procedures;
• Ongoing Enterprise network monitoring for the purpose of
identifying security weaknesses and implementing the necessary
remediation plans
• Actively identifying security weaknesses and identifying the
necessary remediation plan;
