Highlights:
I have a pretty strong technical background. I have gone from creating a simple website on tables, developing and implementing websites on different CMSs with different developers to a professional understanding of Java Script.
Relevant experience:
  – Designing the structure of the future site;
  – improving UX/UI design;
  – writing technical specifications for developers;
  – development of design for desktop and mobile versions;
  – creating a semantic core;
  – optimization of the website for search engines (SEO)
  – interaction with hosting;
  – Scrum master on a team project;
  – 2 Pet-projects from the time of study.

I have an analytical mindset and the ability to self-learn.

CV:
I have a pretty strong technical background. I have gone from creating a simple website on tables, developing and implementing websites on different CMSs with different developers to a professional understanding of Java Script.
