candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Hello! I am a Junior Business Analyst with 6 months of very productive recruiting experience and 6 months of sales management experience. I am energetic, enthusiastic, cheerful, and extremely hardworking. 

Almost everything I do in life I try to pursue with some sort of an algorithm and out-of-the-box thinking - let it be the way to start my morning or learn a new language. Same at work - all of the processes I handle are well-organized and structured.

IT Recruiter -- 09/2021 - 03/2022 -- (0.5 year)

Filling different tech and non-tech positions with all levels of seniority. Responsible for every recruitment stage - from analyzing requirements and sourcing to successful onboarding.
• analyzing job requirements; 
• creating clear and eye-catching vacancies;
• arranging phone calls and meetings;
• conducting initial/semi-technical interviews;
• passing the candidate on to the interview processes;
• reviewing results, giving proper and quick feedback.

Sales Department Representative -- 09/2020 - 03/2021

Analysis of the business model and client needs. Further counseling and provision of information. 
• business model analysis 
• requirements analysis
• creating a sales script 
• negotiations and selling

Looking For:
I am a very open-minded person! And most of all I value honesty and trust, so I want to benefit people, the team, the client, and myself as equals.

Highlights:
• I know the insurance and banking business pretty well;
• Maintained good relationships with everyone I touched: colleagues, clients, and companies;
• Have practical experience with prototypes and mock-ups.
• Know a lot about business analyst work: agile methodologies, SDLC, requirements analysis, etc.
• I have very analytical and algorithmic thinking;
• Good with math and logical riddles;
• Tech-savvy;

Languages:
Ukrainian - native;
English - fluent (C1);
russian - fluent (C2)

English Level:
fluent

Experience Years:
1.0

