candidate_profile:
Position:
CFO / Finance Adviser / Finance & Operations Consultant

Moreinfo:
7 years of experience in international IT companies in finance, 2 as CFO/COO. Can build and optimize financial processes for your company (payroll, invoicing/billing, reporting - you name it), train your staff, implement accounting system (in google sheets or through the software depending on needs and transactions number). Provide management with advising and support not only in finance but all operational management. Have experience in managing operations processes (HR, recruitment, shared resources management including resource management system development and implementation). 
Skills and experience: - Processes implementation and control; - Team hiring and management; - Business processes development and optimization; - Financial/management advising and support for owners and top management; - Pricing modeling; - Managerial accounting; - Budgeting; - Reports preparation and analysis (P&L, revenue and GM analysis, CIR analysis, budget usage etc); - Controlling skills: payments, payroll activities, invoicing, general data validation and check in accounting system.

Looking For:
Ready to help businesses work more effective and ensure profitability and costs optimization in short and long term perspectives.

Highlights:
- Have built management accounting system and 80% of other financial processes (billing, reporting, budgeting, resource management  etc) from scratch for IT company (70+ employees, outsource);
- Created HR department (including recruitment) strategy and team composition for IT company (70+ employees, outsource);
- Created resource management & projects overview system for IT company (70+ employees, outsource);
- Have been in charge of forecasting, controlling and financial advising for delivery unit in IT company (1800+ employees, outsource);
- Successfully optimized bunch of internal financial processes and procedures, including work with documents, data analysis, data validation, reports preparation etc.

English Level:
upper

Experience Years:
7.0

