4+ years of unique blended cross-industries experience in charge of Business Analysis & Solution Consultancy in banking, insurance, telecommunication & vendor side, especially on Digital Financial Services & Digital Identity domains.
Proven track record: Mobile money platform, Biometric Enrollment & Identification/Authentication solution, Omni-channel digital banking, online (Internet) banking, mobile banking, cargo transportation.
Responsibilities:
- Requirements elicitation (in-person interview, workshops, documentation analysis - BRD or/and API specs, wireframing)
- Requirements analysis and specification (business model canvas, context diagram, logical system architecture, flowchart/UML/BPMN diagrams, use cases and user stories);
- Requirements management (validation, versioning, dev team support, prioritization, change request management, impact analysis)
- Participation in solution design together with an architect.
