- Kount;
- Onfido;
- Passfort;
- Jira;
- ZenDesk/Freshdesk;
- PowerBI;
- MySQL (basic knowledge);
- Elliptic;
- Chainalysis (KYT; Reactor);
- Checkout Hub.

