candidate_profile:
Position:
Chief Legal Officer / General Counsel / Experienced International Lawyer

Moreinfo:
Experienced international lawyer and manager
- over 10 years in building and managing legal teams and projects;
- over 10 years of international legal work with leading law firms and clients;
- experience in Contracts; Corporate & M&A; Regulatory and Compliance; Litigation/Dispute Resolution; Data Protection; Intellectual Property; Banking & Finance, etc.;
- international team management: supervising/coordinating up to 5 teams of up to 12 people in 5 different countries;
- a good network of international legal contacts in leading jurisdictions, in particular, in the UK and the USA;
- entrepreneurial/founder experience: over 5 years of running my own legal practice, including performing or supervising basic operations, finance, sales and marketing, and HR functions;
- good listener;
- good writer;
- curious by nature; always learning new things;
- other professional skills: legal writing; legal research and legal analysis; team management and project management; planning and budgeting; staff training and evaluation; selecting, managing and controlling of foreign lawyers; negotiations; interviewing; strategic thinking; process design and implementation.

Looking For:
I am looking for ways to maximize my impact on the economic development of our nation. I am also available for part-time or project-based cooperation.

Highlights:
- managed several large international projects - creating/supervising/coordinating up to 5 teams of up to 12 people in 5 different countries; project duration 1-3 years; 
- was responsible for project budgets over USD 100,000-500,000 per year; 
- managed several cases with the contract/dispute amount over USD 10,000,000;  
- has worked as a top manager (head of the department) in several international law firms: strategic planning, budgeting, basic financial planning; defining targets, functions, and requirements; clarifying market positioning; recruiting people; establishing processes; sales/PR/marketing; team and project management; pitching/presenting/negotiating to potential clients and partners; client/account management;
- recognized by international legal rankings.

