My experience and skills:
• Undertaking AML investigations and file internal STRs.
• Undertaking ongoing AML monitoring and EDD case reviews.
• Undertaking transaction monitoring and investigations for both fiat and crypto products.
• Collaborating with the wider compliance team to resolve and troubleshoot issues relating to regulatory or AMLCFT 
compliance matters.
• Preparing SARs and reporting SARs to financial intelligence units (FIUs).
