Position:
Business Analyst, Project Manager, Compliance specialist

Moreinfo:
Project management:
- Worked as a part of Project Management Office;
- Analyzed the implementation process of projects in order to minimaze the delay and dismissal of key results;
- Checked reports of project managers in terms of accuracy and completeness;
- Created reports of project portfolio of NBU quaterly and yearly;
- Tested configurations of Jira&Confluence;
- Implemented 3 courses for different groups of participants on the topic of Project management via Jira&Confluence.

