- Hubspot Content Marketing Certified;

- Created a ton of different content for a SaaS blog (started from scratch and reached 6000+ monthly visitors in a small-niched industry), email marketing campaigns (17-40% open rate, 2 % click-through rate), social media (posts 7-8 % engagement rate);

- Implemented various analytics tools to keep track of content performance and other metrics.

