Position:
Business Analyst / Operations Manager / Product Manager

Moreinfo:
7 years of experience in IT as Head of Automation Department, Deputy Director and Project Manager. I worked in the segment of implementing CRM systems (service business) and developing a mobile application (product) with team up to 60 people.

⇒ How can I help you with my experience:
∎ Develop your product / project according to the set goals of the company;
∎ Build and upgrade processes for planning, prioritization and performance tracking in CRM and Task Management systems to improve team efficiency and productivity;
∎ Develop and monitor daily, weekly and monthly dashboards / reports and present it to C-level;
∎ Organize and support day-to-day operational tasks;
∎ Develop documentation: instructions / templates / presentations to optimize and systematize the team's work;
∎ Develop, implement and manage team KPI's;
∎ Manage team expenses process and budgets.

If you are looking for a person who will increase the efficiency of your company and make it better, write to me right now ;)

Looking For:
Challenging and interesting tasks, open management, friendly and professional team, flexible schedule.

