candidate_profile:
Position:
CAO, CFO, COO

Moreinfo:
Developing financial and tax strategies Ukraine;
 Advising on long-term business and financial planning;
 Monitoring and directing the implementation of strategic business plans;
 Participate in key decisions as a member of the executive management team;
 Providing leadership, direction and management of the finance and accounting team;
 Oversee the financial operations of subsidiary companies and foreign operations;
 Update and implement financial policies and procedures;
 Establish and implement a training program for new finance employees;
 Oversee the issuance of financial information;
 Supervising financial reporting and budgeting team;
 Oversee the company’s fiscal activity, including budgeting, reporting, and auditing;
 Set up and oversee the company’s finance IT system (PowerOffice);
 Preparing reliable current and forecasting reports;
 Understand and mitigate key elements of the company's risk profile;
 Ensure that record keeping meets the requirements of auditors and government agencies in Ukraine;
 Reporting risk issues to the executive management team;
 Seek out methods and practices to minimise financial risk;
 Advising on cash forecasts;
 Arranging debt financing and equity financing;
 Controlling and evaluating capital structure;
 Maintaining banking relationships in Ukraine
see less.

