Leading a large portfolio of Company operations offices and remote locations to ensure functionality, comfort, safety and efficiency of the Workplace experience by integrating people, place, process and technology. Leading roadmap delivery at a regional level and is a trusted partner for senior stakeholders. Works closely with global team members to assess and implement new policies, processes and changes. Taking responsibility for proper implementation, reporting and integration of the Workplace services and activities. Managing and overseeing the financial management (budget) of the regional WX function. Managing the finances associated with regional supplier contracts; Managing the team's procurement and chargeback procedures in conjunction with chargeback, conducting financial risk management.

