candidate_profile:
Position:
Administrative Specialist

Moreinfo:
Operations and Administrative Specialist with 3+ years experience in FMCG and Software Development companies. 

Main responsibilities:
- plan, coordinate and support document flow; 
- management key contracts and additional agreements in CRM;
- work with budget and payments in internal system and SAP; 
- communication with main departments to solve cases;
- short & long-term organisational operational planning and strategy.

Tools in workflow:
- SAP;
- Trello;
- Excel; 
- Contracts Approval System;
- M.E.Doc;
- Microsoft Office.

Looking For:
I would like to work:
- with strong and friendly team;
- solve cases with impact for company goals;
- have an opportunity for self-development.

