Expirience:
- build new vision in document flow; 
- plan and present contracting process for other departments for the next year;
- keep and update a database in CRM;
- management key contracts and additional agreements in CRM (800 documents per year);
- work with budget and payments in internal system and SAP (750+ contracts per year);
- update data and analyze in Excel.

