candidate_profile:
Position:
Bussines analyst / Project Manager

Moreinfo:
Hello!

I am the Head of business analysis in an IT company with 4 years of experience.
Prior to that, I held the position of project manager in a financial company for 4 years.

Key competencies:
- I am good at systemic and critical thinking;
- I know how to build communication;
- Creative and flexible to change;
- I strive for the ideal, a perfectionist;
- I have the skill of strategic planning;
- Proactive leader;
- Team player.

Responsibilities:
- Setting tasks for the BA team, developers and monitoring their implementation 
- Sprint planning, workload distribution among employees;
- Optimization and control of worker processes;
- Collection of requirements and their formalization in the SRS;
- Formation of labor costs and resource planning for project implementation;
- Description of instructions for users and software administrators.

Looking For:
I am looking for a company with interesting projects, modern approaches in project implementation.
One of the most important factors is a close-knit team of professionals focused on results

Highlights:
Key achievements for all time:
- Implemented more than 20 projects as Head of Business analytics
- The process of managing projects within the team and with the customer has been developed
- Successful cooperation with TOP clients in the banking segment of Ukraine, including: Alfa Bank, Ukrsotsbank, Aval Bank, Bank Credit Dnipro, Idea Bank
- Developed and implemented segmentation of loan portfolios. Work efficiency increased by 8-10%
- A scoring model based on 50+ indicators was developed and implemented. After that we knew what should be paid attention to in order to increase efficiency, and what it is completely inappropriate to spend a resource on. Costs reduced by 15%, efficiency increased by 20%
- Combining into a single cohesive team two opposite directions - a call center and lawyers

