candidate_profile:
Position:
Assistant Project Manager

Moreinfo:
Successful performance of 20+ educational projects for over 500+
members of various companies - Boeing, Ubisoft, Xpand etc
Attentive manager with excellent communication skills.Organised and driven with an innate ability to stay on track while dealing with various tasks under pressure.
Quick learner and eager to pursue the career of a manager in IT field.
-Constant implementation of Agile and Scrum methodologies - performing 1-1,
stand-ups, retrospectives, dealing with the team motivation;
-Applying Lean methodology aiming at continuous project improvement;
-Participating in discussions on the appropriate design and set-up of projects while
understanding the key drivers of project profitability and providing cost-saving
solutions where possible;
-Monitoring, maintaining and enhancing the performance of field operations, ensuring
timely and accurate delivery;
-Serving as a link and liaison across the various stakeholders on project-related
matters;
-Direct communication with customers, clarifying specific requirements, managing
customers’ expectations and changes;
-Project planning, task progress monitoring and prioritizing the workload of the team;
-Preparing and organizing the necessary project documentation;
-Planning and giving regular updates on the projects;
-Coordinating the project launch schedule and activities;
-Risk management.

