candidate_profile:
Position:
Creative Project Manager

Moreinfo:
Experienced Project Manager with 3 years of proven commercial projects realization. In a creative agency, I have been managing cross-functional international teams in full-cycle production of award-winning events and marketing projects. On each step of the career dealt with direct communication with EU and US clients. Performed as a project starter and took part in sales activities. 

As for hard-skills, in projects implemented Agile product development based on Scrum / Kanban, experienced Jira user, qualified at risk management, budgeting and scope planning.

Highlights:
+ Gold and Bronze Eventex awards in nominations Road Show and PR-Campaign;
+ As a part of the talented team created and managed more than 50 events and marketing projects for companies in the EU and US markets from the concept and research to the last dance.
+ Performed direct communication with 20 international IT or manufacturing companies as our clients;
+ Scope planning for the internal agency team of 10 members and hundreds of outside suppliers.
+ Budgeting the projects up to $300000.
+ Deep research and detailed proposals of events for customers (including timelines, venues, suppliers, legal obligations, staffing and budgets);
+ Over 200 pitches for EU market clients;
+ Generated marketing activities for clients that increased sales and hiring +35%;
+ Worked with designers, manufacturers, developers, and tech specialists to implement creative ideas.

