candidate_profile:
Position:
Client Success Manager

Moreinfo:
01/09/2015 - 25/06/2021 – Head of the Student Scientific Surgical Club in Center for Liver, Biliary Tract and Pancreatic Surgery - Kyiv, Ukraine;
Work responsibilities: organization of scientific events and training for medical students.

01/09/2018 – 31/05/2019 – Certified Nutrition Specialist, AliceGood Fitness Center - Kyiv, Ukraine;
Work responsibilities: health coaching, meal planning, client support.

01/08/2021 - 1/08/2022 – Assistant Surgeon, Medical Center of Vascular Surgery “Angios”  - Kyiv, Ukraine; 
Work responsibilities: trainee in vascular surgery (laser surgical treatment of varicosity), preparation of patients for surgery, doppler ultrasound diagnostics, work with medical documentation, and part in surgical operations.

01/07/2021 - 2023 -  Client Success Manager at PD Mangan Coaching (remote) - Miami, Florida, United States;
Work responsibilities: meal planning, ingredients and nutrients databases analysis, client support, graphic design, project management, client communication, task management, sales assistance,  system optimization, team training, data analysis.

01/08/2021 - 31/01/2023 – Senior Assistant at the Department of Surgery with a Course of Emergency and Vascular Surgery of Bogomolets National Medical University – Kyiv, Ukraine;
Work responsibilities: scientific article writing and educational activity.

1/09/2021 - present – Executive Secretary of Ukrainian Peer-Reviewed Scientific-Practical Medical Journal “General Surgery” (part-time, remote) – Kyiv, Ukraine.
Work responsibilities: multilingual translation, scientific article review, project management.

Highlights:
•	The best academic performance of Bogomolets National Medical University, Honors Degree in Medicine, GPA - 5,0 out of 5,0;
•	Awarded with Order of Honor for the valuable contribution and significant success in social and academic activity;
•	Member of Kysil Medical Scientific Society of Bogomolets National Medical University;
•	Active member of Ukrainian Dietetic Association;
•	Over 30 awards in school Olympiads in Biology, Chemistry, World Literature, Ukrainian Language and Literature, German and English;
•	Award for the valuable contribution and significant success in the Student Scientific Society development;
•	1st place diploma for the best research of “April Student Scientific Session -2017” in Surgery; 
•	2nd place diploma for the best research at the Annual Young Medical Scientists’ Conference 2017;
•	2nd place diploma for the best research of “April Student Scientific Session -2017” in Pediatrics;
•	Winner of the International Medical Olympiad “Samarkand-2020” in Uzbekistan;
Native Languages: Ukrainian, russian
Foreign Languages: English (C1), German (C1), Latin Terminology.

