candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Development of a Real estate CRM system (a Management system for a legal company in real estate).
Client: New York, USA.
Responsibilities and skills applied:
 -Communication with the project team and stakeholders;
 -Requirements elicitation;
 -Requirements analysis;
 -Product backlog management;
 -Change requests management;
 -Requirements traceability;
 -Collaboration with designers;
 -Creation of low-fidelity wireframes in Figma as a supplement to Specification;
 -Collaboration with Developers and QA;
 -Project roadmap;
 -Project documentation (RACI matrix, Stakeholder register, Communication plan, Interest/Influence grid, Functional Specification, User stories&Acceptance Criteria, DoD);
 -UML(Activity diagrams, Use case diagrams, Sequence diagrams);
 -BPMN diagrams;
 -Demo, sprint planning, grooming, and other project calls facilitation;


Development of a business website for a construction company.
Client: Ontario, Canada.
A business website for a construction company and a business website that in detail describes the construction company's real estate project, including information about locations, buildings, interactive floor plans view, apartments schemes, etc.
Responsibilities and skills applied:
 -Communication with project team and stakeholders;
 -Requirements elicitation;
 -Functional decomposition;
 -Product backlog management;
 -Change requests management;
 -Collaboration with designers;
 -Low-fidelity wireframes in Figma;
 -Project roadmap;
 -Project documentation (Project overview, RACI matrix, 
 -Communication plan, Stakeholder register, DoD, User stories&Acceptance criteria, Personas, Website map);
 -Market and competitor research;
 -Demo and other Scrum ceremonies facilitation;


Out-of-project activities: 
 -Presale engagement, Estimation, Internal presentations, and meetups.

English Level:
upper

Experience Years:
1.0

