Conducting working meetings with participants in the project team for implementation, support and refinement, according to customer requirements;
Monitoring compliance with deadlines for the implementation of projects;
Monitoring compliance with contractual terms and timely repayment of receivables;
Preparation of commercial offers;
Document management for projects;
Formation of reports and analytical information for company management;
Control and preparation of documentation for participation in tenders.

10.2017 - 01.2019, ATS LLC
Information Technology
Manager of Development and Customer Management 
Maintenance and development of existing customers in the field of electronic document management;
Identification of business needs of customers and selection of optimal product solutions;
Collaboration with related departments upon requests from customers;
Daily monitoring and analysis of traffic flow;
Preparation of commercial offers;
Sale of company services to potential customers;
Conclusion of contracts, billing and payment control;
Budgeting targets.

11.2014 - 10.2017
PJSC “Retail Group”
Manager of logistics
Coordination of contractual terms with customers;
Consulting clients and conducting claims to comply with the terms of the contract;
Cost calculation and billing for logistics services;
Control, reconciliation and approval of invoices issued by external operators;
Analysis and writing of logistic business processes.
Please don't send offers to the sales manager.

