candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Open World 
BA Trainee     
Location Lviv Region, Ukraine

The main responsibilities:
•	Scope and project definition;
•	Stakeholder analysis;
•	Preparing uses cases to organize functional requirements;
•	Requirements gathering; document analysis; writing user stories and acceptance criteria;
•	Managing stakeholder collaboration and expectations through constant communication and interviews;
•	Defining priority of new features;
•	Eliciting, specifying, verifying, and validating business and functional requirements;
•	Creating low-fidelity wire-frames to confirm functional requirements;
•	Modeling business processes using BPMN notation, etc.

