candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
Business Analysis Internship: 
1) Project: a mobile game ‘Who Am I’. 
Responsibilities:  
Prepare several artefacts, including Stakeholder Registration matrix, RACI matrix, Value Proposition Canvas, Glossary, Dictionary, BPMN, User stories and Backlog; 
Create prototype using Figma;
Tools: Figma, Lucid.app, Miro, Jira, Confluence.
2) Project: a mobile app for childrens’ entertainment and development with the possibility for parents to control the content available for their Children and supervise their progress. 
Responsibilities:  
Prepare several artefacts, including Communication Plan, RACI matrix, Benchmarking, Business Motivation Model, Business Model Canvas, Value Proposition Canvas, Solution features, Constraints and Limitations, Assumptions and Dependencies, KPI’s, Roadmap, Business context diagram, Change request flow, Requirements Management Plan, BPMN, User stories and Backlog, Definition of Ready and Definition of Done; 
Create wireframes and prototype using Figma;
Tools: Figma, Lucid.app, Miro, Jira, Confluence.
3) User Experience Designer
Project:
The mobile app for tracking habits.
Responsibilities:  
Created a mobile application prototype design, using Figma; 
Created content;
UAT and end-to-end testing;
Business logic/functional issues investigation;
Tools: Figma, Visual Studio Code/HTML, physical Apple and Android devices, TestFlight.

