candidate_profile:
Position:
Art Director / Senior Product Designer

Moreinfo:
I am a passionate Designer with more than 10 years of experience:

Product Design;
Atomic Design;
Design System;
UX Design;
UI Design;
User Flow / CJM;

I also have skills in:

Cooperation with managers, business analysts, account managers, developers team (frontEnd/backEnd);
Working on startups;
Management;
Cooperation with designers (lead, mentorship, teamwork, etc);
 Close cooperation with clients;
Cooperation with users (testing, interviews, etc.)
Video production (curated the promo video for the mobile app).

I undestand business processes and principles and know how to help the business to get more income and satisfied clients through interface design.
Worked with Betting, Gambling, iGaming, FoodTech, FinTech, AgriTech fields, and many more and clients from Central Europe, United Kingdom, USA, New Zealand, Australia, Israel, CIS countries, Africa.

Looking For:
Product company with clear and well-established processes, professional and supportive management, and talented teammates. Pleasant benefits are welcomed ;)

Highlights:
Created the UX / UI Design of my own POS application (full circle of work);
worked with: Nike Run Club (promo), Siemens (promo website, banners, presentation, etc.), NanoCAD (promo website, banners, presentation, etc.), Oriflame (UX / UI for web application), German Sterlingov (websites about Earth ecology, beekeeping, tea), 
Worked on the niche application The Gift Buster that gained TOP 1 position in App Store USA (in 2020) after UX changes and complete UI redesign.

