Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
In general:
- Participation in projects using SCRUM, Waterfall, V-Model methodologies;

Projects:
- Mobile application and Web interface (Retail);
- Integration of payment systems;
- development of CRM environment;
- Automotive project.

Skills:
- Decomposition of the functional on the basis of the identified requirements (Storymapping);
