candidate_profile:
Position:
2D artist UI/UX designer

Moreinfo:
Hello, my name is Dima. I am UI/UX designer, 2D artist, Game designer over 10 years of experience. I love my work and believe that designers and creative people make the world better. 
I work with: 
 Web/Mobile design ( UX/UI ) - Landing page Design ; - Corporate Website Design; - E-commerce Design ; - Dashboard Design ;
 Gambling design - Slots and Casino design ; - P2P game design; 
 2D Design - Concept Art ; - Landscape Art; - Backgrounds; - Game elements; - 2D Characters design; - 2D Illustration design ; 
NFT colletion design; 
 UI/UX game design .
I have worked with famoust companies and I've closed over 200 projects. For the last 3 years, I started working with game design and prepared NFT collections. Also I've worked with gambling design for 8 slots design, Crypto Roulette and Poker Havana . Made more than 200 arts for the NFT collection, worked on the mobile game Tower Defish and the Space Fighting game for more than 1 Year.

