candidate_profile:
Position:
Business Analyst / Project Manager

Moreinfo:
Hello the potential future colleague,
Hope you're doing well.
If you're reading this I'm pretty sure we can help each other.

ok, let's get to the point. 
I'm working in this field for the last 4 years
The core responsibilities included:
- client nurturing, engagement, and management;
- managing the dev team and stakeholders;
- interactive prototyping and wireframing (MockingBot, Figma);
- BPMN (draw.io, Camunda);
- requirements elicitation and definition;
- preparing user stories and use cases;
- up-saling;
- technical documentation development and validation;

Looking For:
Encountering new challenges and processes is always thrilling.

Anyway, looking for new opportunities and would be glad to hear from you.

Highlights:
I've been working as a sales manager, PM and BA.
Managed teams and clients. Sometimes I think my experience is something unique but actually it isn't :)

