Position:
Business Analyst

Moreinfo:
- 6 years of experience in Logistics, Health Care, FinTech, and Insurance domains.
- Acted as a Business Analyst, Lead Business Analyst, Proxy Product Owner, and Product Owner.

Work experience:
- Presale activities: discoveries, solution proposals, etc.; 
   - Started projects from scratch;
- Communication with customers (including C-level): interview, questionnaire, workshop;
- Investigation and automation of business processes;
- Functional, and non-functional requirements elicitation and management;
- Roadmapping and prioritizing;
