candidate_profile:
Position:
Art Director. Branding and Digital products design.

Moreinfo:
I am a multidisciplinary designer with a total experience of more than 13 years and an art education.
My main specialization is branding, web and app design.
Using my art skills and vast experience in UI design along with deep technical and marketing understanding, I create superior visuals and functional design for projects of any kind.  
My lifelong passion for art and analytical thinking prompted me to study and master all aspects of graphic design and user experience. I am attracted by spectacular graphics solutions, technologies, and micro-interactions.

Looking For:
I love my job and want to exceed my limits.

Highlights:
• Creation and protection of design solutions;
• Analysis and development of user stories;
• Designing and design of sites and applications;
• Designing and creation of adaptive interfaces;
• Prototyping and visualization of interfaces;
• Development and compilation of design systems;
• Development and improvement on style guides;
• Support and consulting in the development process;
• Vector graphics - icons, illustrations;
• Development of logos and corporate identity;
• Development of packaging and labels;
• Layout and design of presentations, catalogs, magazines;
• Development of models of souvenir products;
• Development of layouts of printed products;
• Development of layouts for outdoor advertising;
• Pre-press preparation;
• Quality control of project implementation.

